                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Join the Journey"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Out of all the places that I have traveled in the world, Kauai has touched my heart most deeply. I’m completely in love with this island and am grateful for the immense growth I have experienced living here. She has brought to the surface my deepest pains and opened the door to touch my most ecstatic, authentic, and liberated states of being."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The beauty, wonders, and incredible healing energy here are completely pure and potent. The frequency of the island is a vibrant, palpable emanation of the divine mother. You can’t help but restore deeper depths of love, wisdom, and truth through her reflection."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Remembering more of who you are through meeting her magnificence."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "style": {
            "align": {
              "d": "center"
            }
          }
