              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 2
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "About me"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "My path into healing arts began at a very young age, developing my psychic abilities, compassion, and sensitivities through intense hardship. By the time I was in my late teens, I manifested several physical accidents that resulted in multiple surgeries and severe spinal issues causing unbearable pain.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "This was the very catalyst to launch me passionately onto my path of seeking modalities that would liberate me from my physical and emotional suffering. I've now traveled the world studying a variety of powerful transformational tools and healing modalities in diverse ranges of teachings and ancient wisdom traditions. Ranging from yoga of the voice, ancestral healing, NLP, Internal family systems, energy healing, chi gong, tao tantra, improv, meditation, plant medicine, yin yoga, sound healing, and women's circle facilitation. My passion is in helping others turn their pain into power, access their creative potential, and live a life they love.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
